      {
        "name": "README.md",
        "bytes": 3308,
        "opening": "# diy-platform\n\nDIY 定制平台-衣服印花系统。商品定制编辑器 + 管理后台 + 服务端\n***(需要定制+v:  June_Qiu_0324)***\n\n## 结构\n\n```\napps/\n  h5/        @diy/h5       移动端定制编辑器（Vue3 + Vant + fabric v6，vue-router 双页面）\n  admin/     @diy/admin    管理后台（Vue3 + TS + SCSS + UnoCSS + Element Plus，含登录/RBAC）\n  server/    @diy/server   服务端（NestJS 10 + node:sqlite，端口 4000）\n             ├ data/       SQLite 数据库（diy.db，运行时生成）\n             └ uploads/"
      }
    ],
    "package": {
      "name": "diy-platform",
      "private": true,
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "scripts": {
        "dev:server": "pnpm --filter @diy/server start:dev",
        "dev:admin": "pnpm --filter @diy/admin dev",
        "dev:h5": "pnpm --filter @diy/h5 dev",
        "build:admin": "pnpm --filter @diy/admin build",
        "build:server": "pnpm --filter @diy/server build"
      },
      "packageManager": "pnpm@11.8.0"
    }
  },
